	(text "RK3588 unit 5: HDMI/eDP transmitters, HDMI receiver, MIPI CSI/DSI. None is used on this board\n(setup video goes out over USB-C DisplayPort from the Type-C PHYs).\nSupply pins are powered from the same rails as on the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic (sheets 16, 17), with one\n100 nF each; all signal, REXT and VREG pins are left open. Two rails were not readable from the reference and are\nassigned by voltage (HDMI/eDP AVDD_0V75, HDMI_RX_DVDD). Confirm this unused-block treatment against\nRockchip's hardware design guide before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
